-- title:
--   Admissible small constants stable under the decomposition group
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $q \ge 5$, let $M'$ be a nonzero natural number not divisible by $q$, and let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q} =$ `AlgebraicClosure ℚ` satisfying `A.LiesOverPrime q`, i.e. the image of $q$ lies in `A.nonunits`. Then there exist an intermediate field $k_0$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}/\mathbb Q$ and an element $\pi_0 \in k_0$ whose image in $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ lies in $A$ such that, writing $A_0 = A \cap k_0$ for the comap of $A$ along $k_0 \to \overline{\mathbb Q}$: $A_0$ is a discrete valuation ring whose maximal ideal is the principal ideal generated by $\pi_0$; $A_0$ is a henselian local ring; the residue field of $A_0$ is algebraically closed; every $a \in A$ is congruent modulo the maximal ideal of $A$ to (the image of) some $c \in k_0$ with $c \in A$; and $k_0$ is carried to itself by every $\mathbb Q$-algebra automorphism $\tau$ of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ with $x \in A \iff \tau x \in A$ for all $x$. Moreover there is a prime $\ell$ with $\ell \ge 3$, $\ell \ne q$ and $\ell \nmid M'$, an element $\zeta_0 \in k_0$ which is a primitive $(q\ell)$-th root of unity in $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, and an element $\varpi_t \in k_0$ lying in $A$ together with a unit $u$ of $A$ such that $\varpi_t^{\,q^2-1} = q\,u$ in $\overline{\mathbb Q}$.
--
--   This provides the field of "small constants" $k_0$ together with its auxiliary data (uniformiser, auxiliary prime $\ell$, root of unity $\zeta_0$, and a $(q^2-1)$-st root of $q$ up to units) used in the local analysis at $q$ of modular curves; the field $k_0$ is the fixed field of the inertia subgroup of $A$ over a number field, so $A_0$ is a strictly henselian discrete valuation ring with algebraically closed residue field and $k_0$ is stable under the decomposition group. It strengthens [`ValuationSubring.exists_admissible_smallConstants`](thm.html#ValuationSubring.exists_admissible_smallConstants) by the stability conjunct, and is used by [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_igusaSmoothPointCharts_of_igusaGaussRing_allInertia`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_igusaSmoothPointCharts_of_igusaGaussRing_allInertia).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_exists_admissible_smallConstants_stable.lean

